  "HDDS-7342": {
    "jira_id": "HDDS-7342",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Move encryption-related code to OzoneCryptoInputStream",
    "description": "In case of an encrypted MPU key {{MultipartCryptoKeyInputStream}} is combining the parts, where each is decrypted with {{OzoneCryptoInputStream}}.\r\n\r\nThe issue is that the code that aligns the bytes with crypto buffer boundary, while being part-specific, resides in {{MultipartCryptoKeyInputStream}}. \r\nThe proposed solution is to move encryption into {{OzoneCryptoInputStream}} itself.",
